# PgBouncer — Session Mode (Current Deployment)

PgBouncer was deployed on **2026-04-26** in front of PostgreSQL on the production VPS (GREEN, 68.183.168.75). It runs in **`POOL_MODE: session`** — the safe default that preserves all session state. Transaction mode is the long-term goal but is blocked on four codebase issues that have not been remediated.

